# Autocomplete box
Autocomplete Box combines text search with a selectable list. Use it for larger option sets where a native select becomes slow to scan. The first enabled result is highlighted automatically, so Enter selects the highest-ranked match while typing.

Use `name` to submit the selected value in a form. `filter` overrides default case-insensitive label matching; `maxResults` limits displayed matches.

Set `allowCustomValue={false}` when the value must be one of the listed options. Typed text that has not been selected will not be submitted.
